<title>USA: Excel Realty sells 2.5 mln shrs to Salomon.</title>
<headline>Excel Realty sells 2.5 mln shrs to Salomon.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excel Realty Trust Inc said Friday it would sell 2.5 million newly issued common shares to Salomon Inc's Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Excel made the announcement in a press release. No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
